    {
      "text": "Kecleon alters its body coloration to blend in with its surroundings, allowing it to sneak up on its prey unnoticed. Then it lashes out with its long, stretchy tongue to instantly ensnare the unsuspecting target.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It changes its hue to blend into its surroundings. If no one takes notice of it for too long, it will pout and never reveal itself.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its color changes for concealment and also when its mood or health changes. The darker the color, the healthier it is.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
